<title>UK: London sugar freight.</title>
<headline>London sugar freight.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>New orders - Cargill 25,000 bulk Santos or Paranagua to Morocco, Egyptian Med, Baltic or Black Sea July.</p>
<p>Dreyfus 14,000 bagged Brazil to Red Sea mid-July.</p>
<p>Geepee 10/12,000 bagged Bangkok to Red Sea prompt.</p>
<p>Kerry Trading 12,000 bagged South China to Pakistan mid-July and 10,000 bulk Thailand to South Korea mid-July.</p>
<p>Fixtures - Glencore 13/14,000 bagged Santos or Parangua to Red Sea prompt.</p>
<p>E D and F Man 14,000 baggged Durban to Iran early July.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
